      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To initiate the process for mobile application and integration with the suppliers network system, begin by starting and entering the metadata."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening clause implicitly starts the process (init) and explicitly defines the first action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After entering the metadata, proceed to the IN-Patient step."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct mapping to the sequential step described immediately after metadata entry."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3",
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "At the same time, complete the following steps: send data to suppliers and create a claim."
      ],
      "justification": "'At the same time' implies concurrent execution, justifying the AND gateway. The two listed tasks map directly to the parallel actions."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the data is sent to suppliers, extract the data from the suppliers and transfer it to the doctor's phone."
      ],
      "justification": "The sequential operations described in this clause map exactly to the two action nodes."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, confirm the GOP and the process will come to an end."
      ],
      "justification": "Action n7 matches 'confirm the GOP'; the closing phrase explicitly signals the termination of this path via e1."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9",
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, register the case and handle the claim."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct mapping to the two sequential actions listed in this step."
    },
    {
