        "guard:b1->n13",
        "guard:b1->n14"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Extract the data from the suppliers and enter it on the patient's record or confirm the IN-Patient status."
      ],
      "justification": "First clause maps to n11. The 'or' choice is structurally modeled by XOR branch b1 splitting into n13/n14 with synthetic guards, while n12 restates the combined choice. All align with the source span."
    },
    {
